{"title":"Career roadmap · Aerospace Design Engineer","role":"Aerospace Design Engineer","summary":"An Aerospace Design Engineer designs, analyses and validates aircraft, spacecraft, propulsion systems, structures and aerospace components. The role combines aerodynamics, aircraft structures, materials, propulsion, CAD/CAE, fluid mechanics, controls and manufacturing.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Aerospace design intern, graduate design engineer, CAD/CAE engineer, aerospace structures/analysis trainee"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"What should I specialise in?","output":"Aerostructures, aerodynamics, propulsion, aircraft systems, UAVs or spacecraft design"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Aerospace Design Engineer, Lead Design Engineer or Systems Engineer"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How do I remain relevant?","output":"Aerospace Design Lead, Chief Engineer, Systems Architect or Aerospace R&D leader"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For an Aerospace/Aeronautical Engineering graduate, this is a directly aligned career path."},{"type":"p","text":"Typical employers and sectors include aircraft manufacturers, defence companies, space organisations, aerospace suppliers, airlines/MROs, UAV companies and aerospace R&D laboratories."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build this","Key skills","Proof of progress"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Engineering foundation"},{"text":"Mathematics, mechanics, physics, programming, engineering graphics"},{"text":"CAD model + basic engineering analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Aerospace fundamentals"},{"text":"Aerodynamics, fluid mechanics, materials, aircraft structures, thermodynamics"},{"text":"Aircraft component design project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"CAD/CAE + specialised analysis"},{"text":"CATIA/SolidWorks/NX, ANSYS, CFD, FEA, structural analysis"},{"text":"Validated CAD/CAE project"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Integrated aerospace design"},{"text":"Aircraft configuration, systems, optimisation, manufacturing and testing"},{"text":"Complete aircraft/UAV design project"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Engineering foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Mathematics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Calculus"},{"text":"Differential equations"},{"text":"Linear algebra"},{"text":"Probability/statistics"},{"text":"Numerical methods"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Engineering"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Engineering mechanics"},{"text":"Engineering graphics"},{"text":"Materials"},{"text":"Basic electrical/electronics"},{"text":"Thermodynamics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Programming"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"MATLAB"},{"text":"C/C++ fundamentals"},{"text":"Git"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CAD"},{"type":"p","text":"Start with one professional CAD system:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CATIA"},{"text":"Siemens NX"},{"text":"SolidWorks"},{"text":"Autodesk Fusion"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Design a small fixed-wing UAV in CAD."},{"type":"p","text":"Produce:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"3D model"},{"text":"Basic dimensions"},{"text":"Weight estimate"},{"text":"Centre-of-gravity estimate"},{"text":"Material selection"},{"text":"Technical drawing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Aerospace fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop strong knowledge of:"},{"type":"h","text":"Aerodynamics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Airfoil theory"},{"text":"Lift"},{"text":"Drag"},{"text":"Moment"},{"text":"Boundary layers"},{"text":"Reynolds number"},{"text":"Mach number"},{"text":"Stall"},{"text":"Wing design"},{"text":"Stability basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Fluid mechanics"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Continuity"},{"text":"Bernoulli equation"},{"text":"Momentum equations"},{"text":"Viscous flow"},{"text":"Compressible flow"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft structures"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Stress"},{"text":"Strain"},{"text":"Bending"},{"text":"Torsion"},{"text":"Buckling"},{"text":"Fatigue"},{"text":"Composite structures"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Propulsion"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Turbofan"},{"text":"Turbojet"},{"text":"Turboprop"},{"text":"Ramjet"},{"text":"Rocket fundamentals"},{"text":"Propeller systems"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Perform an airfoil aerodynamic analysis."},{"type":"p","text":"Compare several airfoils using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Lift coefficient"},{"text":"Drag coefficient"},{"text":"Lift-to-drag ratio"},{"text":"Angle of attack"},{"text":"Reynolds number"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — CAD/CAE specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"This is where the student should become industry-oriented."},{"type":"h","text":"CAD"},{"type":"p","text":"Become proficient in one major aerospace CAD platform:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CATIA"},{"text":"Siemens NX"},{"text":"SolidWorks"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Part design"},{"text":"Assembly"},{"text":"Surface modelling"},{"text":"Sheet metal"},{"text":"GD&T"},{"text":"Engineering drawings"},{"text":"Design for manufacturing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"FEA"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Structural modelling"},{"text":"Meshing"},{"text":"Boundary conditions"},{"text":"Stress analysis"},{"text":"Deformation"},{"text":"Modal analysis"},{"text":"Fatigue basics"},{"text":"Buckling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ANSYS"},{"text":"Abaqus"},{"text":"NASTRAN/Patran"}]},{"type":"h","text":"CFD"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Geometry preparation"},{"text":"Meshing"},{"text":"Boundary conditions"},{"text":"Turbulence basics"},{"text":"Convergence"},{"text":"Post-processing"},{"text":"Validation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful tools include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"ANSYS Fluent"},{"text":"OpenFOAM"},{"text":"STAR-CCM+"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project"},{"type":"p","text":"Design and analyse an aircraft wing structure."},{"type":"p","text":"Deliver:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"CAD model"},{"text":"Material selection"},{"text":"Mesh"},{"text":"Loading assumptions"},{"text":"Stress analysis"},{"text":"Deformation analysis"},{"text":"Factor of safety"},{"text":"Design optimisation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4 — Integrated aerospace design"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Configuration design"},{"text":"Weight estimation"},{"text":"Performance"},{"text":"Stability"},{"text":"Control surfaces"},{"text":"Landing gear"},{"text":"Propulsion integration"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Systems"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Flight controls"},{"text":"Avionics"},{"text":"Electrical systems"},{"text":"Hydraulic systems"},{"text":"Fuel systems"},{"text":"Environmental control"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Manufacturing"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Machining"},{"text":"Composites"},{"text":"Additive manufacturing"},{"text":"Sheet-metal fabrication"},{"text":"Design for manufacturing"},{"text":"Design for assembly"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Systems engineering"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Requirements"},{"text":"Trade studies"},{"text":"Interface control"},{"text":"Verification"},{"text":"Validation"},{"text":"Configuration management"},{"text":"Technical documentation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year project"},{"type":"h","text":"Design and Analysis of an Electric VTOL/UAV"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"h","text":"Mission requirements"},{"type":"h","text":"Aircraft configuration"},{"type":"h","text":"Aerodynamic analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Structural design"},{"type":"h","text":"Propulsion selection"},{"type":"h","text":"CAD"},{"type":"h","text":"CFD/FEA"},{"type":"h","text":"Performance analysis"},{"type":"h","text":"Prototype/simulation"},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"MTOW"},{"text":"Payload"},{"text":"Range/endurance"},{"text":"Propulsion requirements"},{"text":"Wing sizing"},{"text":"Structural loads"},{"text":"Stability"},{"text":"Power consumption"},{"text":"Material selection"},{"text":"Manufacturing considerations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A project with CAD + CFD/FEA + engineering calculations + physical prototype/test data is much stronger than a CAD-only model."},{"type":"h","text":"4-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If an honours/research year is available, specialise deeply in one area:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Aerostructures"},{"text":"Computational fluid dynamics"},{"text":"Aircraft design optimisation"},{"text":"Electric propulsion"},{"text":"UAV design"},{"text":"Hypersonic aerodynamics"},{"text":"Spacecraft structures"},{"text":"Propulsion"},{"text":"Autonomous aerospace systems"},{"text":"Composite materials"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Core stack","Potential senior role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Aerostructures"},{"text":"CATIA/NX, FEA, composites, fatigue"},{"text":"Structural Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Aerodynamics"},{"text":"CFD, fluid mechanics, MATLAB/Python"},{"text":"Aerodynamics Lead"}],[{"text":"Aircraft Design"},{"text":"CAD, CFD, FEA, aircraft performance"},{"text":"Aircraft Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Propulsion"},{"text":"Thermodynamics, CFD, turbomachinery"},{"text":"Propulsion Engineer"}],[{"text":"UAV Design"},{"text":"Aerodynamics, structures, controls"},{"text":"UAV Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Spacecraft Design"},{"text":"Orbital mechanics, structures, thermal"},{"text":"Spacecra